      "content": "that makes sense. i guess i'm just curious if there's a broader pattern with the people there too. do you see a difference in the actual professional mindset or how people approach accountability in these regions? like, is there a certain \"culture\" in these markets that makes one group more inherently reliable as partners than the other?",
